      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "A PCDM-specific JIRA project. We've already agreed roundly and in a public forum that PCDM is a fine effort that does not belong in Fedora and should not be using Fedora's resources. Putting issues for it here just confuses the matter.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
